go/coverage.out

# Go coverage build artifacts. `make cov-go` builds instrumented binaries
# into go/bin and raw counter files into go/covdata, then removes both --
# but only on success, so a FAILING coverage run leaves them behind and
# the next `git add -A` sweeps 12 MB of binaries into the commit (as one
# did in cc0c2d9).
go/bin/
go/covdata/
go/coverage*.out

# Build artifacts (never commit binaries)
go/aontu
go/bin/
go/covdata/
